# Azure AI Vision — Computer Vision resource (Read OCR, API v3.2).
# Create a free-tier (F0) resource: https://portal.azure.com -> Create a resource ->
# "Computer Vision" (or "Azure AI Vision") -> Pricing tier: Free F0.
# 5,000 transactions/month, 20/min, 4 MB max image. One free resource per subscription per region.
#
# Copy this file to .env and fill in your own values. .env is git-ignored — never commit real keys.
# Optional: PaddleOCR needs no account or key at all.

AZURE_CV_ENDPOINT=https://<your-resource-name>.cognitiveservices.azure.com/
AZURE_CV_KEY=<your-subscription-key>
